[{"title":"咏镜","author":"金朝觐","text":"当面是前因，回头是后身。\n总宜明处照，了得本来真。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11190,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿白旗堡","author":"金朝觐","text":"料峭东风路，残阳柳外斜。\n晚烟低野戍，归鸟起平沙。\n客梦仍茅店，春冰尚雪花。\n劳劳车马地，何事集喧哗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11191,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡辽河","author":"金朝觐","text":"莫莫轻寒道阻长，临流马意怯波凉。\n冰痕浮涨鱼鳞细，沙碛惊风羊角狂。\n川路有情怜过隙，春秋无恙祝高堂。\n年来时缅趋庭训，履薄临深矢勿忘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11192,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无题","author":"金朝觐","text":"高楼深院锁垂杨，曲槛回栏绕洞房。\n小住佳人时俏立，偷閒婢子学迷藏。\n几回轻燕窥珠箔，漫逐飞花过粉墙。\n遗却金钗浑未觉，相携笑语过西廊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11193,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书院内小斋花草去年所手植也今又重开感而赋之 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"今年花是去年栽，两度花期两度开。\n寒去暑来时物改，年年底事看花来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11194,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书院内小斋花草去年所手植也今又重开感而赋之 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"香国迟留方作客，芳园寥落最伤春。\n我来恰入东风律，花信犹知识故人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11195,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书院内小斋花草去年所手植也今又重开感而赋之 其三","author":"金朝觐","text":"掩映东墙接绿阴，重门不启碧苔深。\n偷閒只合窥园去，恐负黄花一片心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11196,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书院内小斋花草去年所手植也今又重开感而赋之 其四","author":"金朝觐","text":"人不怜花花自怜，夙根不断又鲜妍。\n花神再度生香意，认取前身结后缘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11197,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"金朝觐","text":"复岭连云暗，孤帆入雾低。\n数家烟火处，遥在小桥西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11198,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次梅澥梦鹤轩夜坐元韵","author":"金朝觐","text":"花天晴爽露华融，斜照残霞落晚红。\n乡梦欲归虚夜月，故人相约共清风。\n砧寒向晓千家动，桐老惊秋一叶空。\n独有诗翁观物妙，尘襟不入太虚中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11199,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读西域闻见录","author":"金朝觐","text":"信有骚人制作雄，新疆西尽九州同。\n皮冠靴屦人伦外，雪海冰山大地中。\n险绝难劳槎客访，灵奇未许谢公穷。\n总因王气归东土，一任车书万里通。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11200,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"文溯阁","author":"金朝觐","text":"星斗焕天章，熙朝制作光。\n文昭灵宝瑞，书启酉山藏。\n玉检涵蓬观，金题拥墨庄。\n沿洄宗圣海，条理总皇纲。\n考义详于度，垂谋典以常。\n是尊天一阁，能益智千囊。\n工轶碑摹篆，劳嗤石作仓。\n薪传寻坠绪，逸事极穷荒。\n勒鼎功同禹，铭盘志比汤。\n留都思溯始，方策示无忘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11201,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"星河淡淡露盈盈，三五秋光月更明。\n到处圆灵金镜朗，此身写照玉壶清。\n蟾蜍仙府长生药，瓜果人间不夜城。\n应是沧溟通桂窟，香风两袖试骑鲸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11202,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋二首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"徙倚中庭怯晚寒，为怜今夜月团栾。\n蟾光不辨芦花白，镜影还流桂子丹。\n诗酒徘徊消客思，风雷倏忽过云端。\n嫦娥如许重回首，明远楼前尽可看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11203,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄家书有咏","author":"金朝觐","text":"平安惟有一函书，惆怅天涯问视疏。\n驿使不来经两月，可知近日复何如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11204,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次于东浦闻雁元韵","author":"金朝觐","text":"霜信何来动碧林，西风吹雁下寒岑。\n远离关塞星初落，秋到潇湘水正深。\n应共露盘惊鹤梦，遥怜筝柱写乡心。\n遗音欲断衡阳浦，已是更阑玉漏沈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11205,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋兴回文","author":"金朝觐","text":"峦翠拖霞淡抹空，远天极望入林枫。\n寒山晚去孤云白，落叶秋零半树红。\n残简断编修永夜，异乡离梦有清风。\n酸心客景烟尘俗，鞍马别途归唳鸿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11206,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿李松峰斋中","author":"金朝觐","text":"别馆秋光晚，澄溪绕寺门。\n屋连渔火岸，人在水云村。\n宿鸟栖钟纽，寒虫咽草根。\n谁怜乡国异，俯仰几黄昏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11207,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题佟松泉小照","author":"金朝觐","text":"松崖悬瀑布，泉眼近云坛。\n思得携琴往，同君一再弹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11208,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读山泉联吟集题后","author":"金朝觐","text":"山籁泉音应感通，遥遥宦旅寄诗筒。\n事经艰险翻多韵，思入穷愁愈见工。\n形影二人文字里，关山千里梦魂中。\n从来博识资名胜，得意文章类史公。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11209,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"法帖","author":"金朝觐","text":"是谁新集鲁公书，尺牍珍藏我所无。\n伪本竞传多宝塔，此真面目识匡庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11210,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古意","author":"金朝觐","text":"皎皎河汉明，迟迟更漏永。\n与郎诉相思，恩情成画饼。\n郎自有新入，妾自怜孤影。\n隔帘见郎来，衿襦强自整。\n西闺笑语声，欢乐何驰骋。\n视昔犹红颜，未解郎薄倖。\n展我罗衣裳，修我红素绠。\n夜深语侍儿，无为妾悲哽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11211,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谢书画七言绝句","author":"金朝觐","text":"喜见华笺翰墨新，标题书画总如神。\n幽兰怪石饶清兴，还与诗人自写真。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11212,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀朝鲜奉使诸公","author":"金朝觐","text":"一别东郊送客镳，鞭丝帽影共飘飖。\n剧怜海国相知少，也料萍踪后会遥。\n荒馆无人巢旧燕，寒江有路捲归潮。\n几回检点留题句，拟向西风再续貂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11213,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答梦鹤轩主人并呈怀朝鲜使臣诗","author":"金朝觐","text":"秋树寒云望海东，乃心先得我心同。\n多惭太上忘情者，真欲临笺问老翁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11214,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋郊独步","author":"金朝觐","text":"不道萧森气，秋来只一般。\n几多芳草色，剩有旧苔斑。\n归鸟下寒树，断云开远山。\n终年无寸进，未敢忆刀环。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11215,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过白大将军墓二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"蔓草荒烟墓道横，将军百战气犹生。\n白杨响入秋风里，还是雷霆叱咤声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11216,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过白大将军墓二首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"石马临风尚欲嘶，松阴犹似阵云低。\n忠魂凛凛黄泉下，遥认灵旗指日西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11217,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"呈梅澥先生二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"世上相知到处新，惟君从不染嚣尘。\n定能老去文章壮，不独生平面目真。\n与我交情论四载，于人和气属三春。\n岂愁鬓发丝丝白，犹是欢娱得顺亲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11218,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"呈梅澥先生二首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"风流不歇尚先民，总为文章现化身。\n摩诘是诗皆画品，真卿无笔不端人。\n储材定许成多士，食俸何须侈万缗。\n从此传家兼报国，徽音嗣以石麒麟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11219,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"留别邴西津","author":"金朝觐","text":"一识荆州令望奢，每从甲子数年华。\n休教白发雄心少，肯负青云壮志赊。\n五夜时勤灯下草，三春定摘榜中花。\n前程无限登瀛路，何事谋官上早衙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11220,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿永安桥忆郡中诸友 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"行尽城西卅里程，虹桥西去路纵横。\n悲欢昨夜酬诗酒，忍听寒波瑟瑟声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11221,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿永安桥忆郡中诸友 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"三春一梦总朦胧，画壁诗成思未穷。\n咫尺天涯何处是，不堪回首暮云东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11222,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"金朝觐","text":"不见乾坤老，难堪节序更。\n谁怜辞旧岁，重似别离情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11223,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答邴西津书题后即依见赠元韵","author":"金朝觐","text":"东风惠我好诗篇，两地相思心欲然。\n不为阳春消别恨，更期景福与文全。\n避贤坐接龙门会，指日旋看凤诏宣。\n落落竟成平素志，秕糠应笑反居前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11224,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻雁二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"犹怯馀寒在，春阴淡欲晴。\n东风吹入律，云外两三声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11225,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻雁二首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"不作悲秋意，关山一路春。\n似将消息报，看取再来宾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11226,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重写诗草偶成七绝一首","author":"金朝觐","text":"果为传诗误大苏，读书便合识之无。\n预知往日难回首，留作他年记事珠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11227,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"玉佛","author":"金朝觐","text":"见说西方有圣人，权将玉质奉金身。\n幽龛合现庄严相，寰宇常随去住因。\n最上菩提归宝觉，无馀灭度豁迷津。\n拈花略示如来意，顿悟文心净六尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11228,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春晓","author":"金朝觐","text":"春梦醒迟冻欲消，何来深巷卖饧箫。\n重帘合趁新晴捲，不禁阳和上柳条。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11229,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春晚","author":"金朝觐","text":"春色迷离向晚看，添衣聊为耐馀寒。\n松枝烧入茶铛火，一任轻烟出画栏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11230,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读西湖志纂二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"想像馀杭风景同，披寻犹在画图中。\n可怜富贵延南宋，犹忆神仙说葛翁。\n梵宇云深飞鹫岭，层楼水面阚龙宫。\n凭他写入丹青笔，输与诗人体物工。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11231,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读西湖志纂二首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"林有孤山苏有堤，勾留白傅是湖西。\n六桥花雨仍遗迹，十里笙歌半客蹊。\n天子时巡筹富庶，才人情思寄标题。\n何年得入星槎路，不隔浮云望眼迷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11232,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日感怀","author":"金朝觐","text":"坐阅先庚又后庚，风光不觉在清明。\n看来锦绣饶三月，恐为诗书误一生。\n花鸟依依儿女态，云山渺渺弟兄情。\n世人未解因时乐，只向天涯作送迎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11233,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日怀梅澥先生用年前见赠元韵二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"共君约略月维三，无限情怀只内含。\n芳草思归春未老，晓窗贪睡梦初酣。\n偶因空冀曾过北，本为敲诗忆指南。\n吟罢小桃红欲绽，却怜花信尚包函。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11234,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日怀梅澥先生用年前见赠元韵二首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"仰正无嫌渎再三，缘知大美在中含。\n殷勤隔院酬诗久，相共挑灯听雨酣。\n春树萦怀同渭北，折梅逢驿便江南。\n遥思桥外藏云处，花屿生机又实函。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11235,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"见梅澥先生所绘兰草感怀","author":"金朝觐","text":"芳草入丹青，幽然无伴侣。\n临笺细玩之，似共同心语。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11236,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"香篆留烟不捲帘，嘤嘤山鸟唤晴檐。\n跫然客屦云深处，知是何人访宋纤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11237,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"杖藜孤往隔重岚，暖日晴云土意酣。\n叱犊冲烟人语处，不知山北与山南。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11238,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其三","author":"金朝觐","text":"律转东皇焕物华，莺花富贵属谁家。\n山中宰相无多事，管得池塘两部蛙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11239,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其四","author":"金朝觐","text":"消得风光未了春，多情花鸟最相亲。\n无端添入深闺恨，甘作人间薄命人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11240,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其五","author":"金朝觐","text":"向晚山云去欲留，何人吹笛写清愁。\n试听哀怨如相语，岂是骑牛牧竖流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11241,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其六","author":"金朝觐","text":"从容花事去安排，不断生香与物皆。\n惟有孤山林处士，却于妻子见高怀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11242,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其七","author":"金朝觐","text":"不尽葱青树色深，幽居恰比小禅林。\n青山若许榆钱买，肯让祇园布地金。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11243,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其八","author":"金朝觐","text":"春草生如晤旧知，春风来似慰相思。\n杏花开处桃花发，正是劳人小住时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11244,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清明二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"不隔花村路，酣红上小桃。\n鱼争溪涨暖，雁度海风高。\n士节甘龙蛰，臣心淡雉膏。\n绵山烟漠漠，何处觅蛇号。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11245,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清明二首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"是谁甘介节，长揖薄侯封。\n白发招偕隐，青山杳旧踪。\n禁烟隆报士，寒食不因冬。\n纵有绵田奉，难将母氏饔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11246,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"广宁道上忧旱二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"十日征途往复还，翻因苦旱念民艰。\n独留夕照明郊甸，尽有晴岚带远山。\n芳树笼阴皆暑气，老农挥汗尚愁颜。\n谁知霖雨成何日，空望浮云去住閒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11247,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"广宁道上忧旱二首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"祈祷封山作雨云，风霾镇日苦炎氛。\n曾惊泽国无馀润，合向桑林忆旧闻。\n杯酒不消心似醉，燃眉何计志如焚。\n功名望已深饥渴，岂似民情待泽殷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11248,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"应乡试西上","author":"金朝觐","text":"几日行程傍海涯，云山回望是吾家。\n庭槐近午萦清梦，路柳斜阳带晚霞。\n难得临时文入彀，可能到处雨随车。\n翻因旱甚思乡土，无复閒情玩物华。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11249,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"法王禅林早起二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"梵径深沉少客踪，晓窗睡起揽衣慵。\n醒闻清磬香初下，认是阇黎饭后钟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11250,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"法王禅林早起二首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"不是禅栖水月邻，齑盐岁月反安贫。\n老僧休说斋粮少，我佛原为乞食人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11251,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丁卯秋试遇蓟州蒋力斋先生于京邸","author":"金朝觐","text":"相士休将冀北空，共君三五月明中。\n帘前工谱霓裳曲，云外香飘桂子风。\n十载光阴归玉尺，三条烛焰对金虫。\n际兹铁树当华日，合报先春到蓟东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11252,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过十三山口占","author":"金朝觐","text":"北镇临青幽，山尽南山口。\n峭茜如列屏，岚光入虚牖。\n古洞锁金牛，神物夜出走。\n不为五丁驱，粪金日一斗。\n岂似田间来，洪縻系人手。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11253,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"出都后忆旧二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"千里栖迟客是家，梦魂飞去海天涯。\n窗含晓色涵虚白，知是霜华与月华。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11254,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"出都后忆旧二首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"萍踪泡影与浮沉，情海茫茫入更深。\n任是西天称极乐，人间愁苦也惊心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11255,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"挽邴西津二绝 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"多情不能久，相嘱独遗诗。\n谁识长相思，终成古别离。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11256,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"挽邴西津二绝 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"君心何绝决，我意复冥冥。\n秋雁天涯去，关山黑复青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11257,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水仙花","author":"金朝觐","text":"定知仙品不寻常，近得江南异种香。\n泉石自甘心共白，缥缃借润甲初黄。\n冰肌玉骨差同味，金盏银台欲比芳。\n岂似牡丹资沃土，誇称富贵侈称王。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11258,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同沈秀岚月下联句","author":"金朝觐","text":"片月挂银河，流光一掷过。\n梦魂乡国异，胸臆宿星罗。\n昂首天空碧，挑灯夜啸歌。\n游仙寻旧梦，云路莫蹉跎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11259,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]